# RailPulse — ALL provider keys, committed on purpose (owner's decision).
# Resolution order everywhere: OS/Render environment  >  this file.
# So: zero environment variables needed on Render; overrides still possible.
#
# Browser keys (VITE_*) are baked into the JS bundle by Vite at build time
# (frontend/vite.config.js sets envDir: '..'). Protect them with ORIGIN
# RESTRICTIONS in the provider dashboards, not with secrecy.
# Rotate everything after the hackathon, or make the repository private.

